  "_doc": "Isomorphism fixture — the `lares` CLI verb surface for the three-way parity test (CLI command-table ↔ MCP tool-set ↔ this table). `mirrored` = the seat's tool names (the anchor); `cli_forms` maps each tool to its CLI spelling; `mirror_hosts` = the CLI TOP-LEVEL commands those spellings land on (the coverage partition); `call_heads` = the heads they land on that the CLI's call door reads outside its command table; `not_yet_mirrored` = verbs − mirror_hosts (each reaches the seat's `act` by its carriers' addresses, never by a tool of its own); `local_seat` = CLI sub-verbs that run over a file with no daemon and hold no seat by law; `analyze_lenses` = the `sense analyze` lens table (lens → daemon verb) and `analyze_lens_aliases` the canon house names each flowing to a lens, and `analyze_lens_reads` the flags each lens reads (a stray one refuses by name on both skins), all read off the CLI. Invariant: mirror_hosts ∪ not_yet_mirrored == verbs. Generated by gen_cli_verbs.mjs.",
